Package: pwrSim
Type: Package
Title: Power Analysis for Mixed Effects Models via Simulation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hamid", "Bulut", email = "hamid.bulut@uni.lu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides tools for estimating statistical power via simulation for 
    mixed effects models with interactions. This package allows researchers to 
    determine adequate sample sizes and assess the power of their experimental 
    designs before data collection. Supports various random effect structures 
    and interaction terms.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    lme4 (>= 1.1-27),
    stats,
    methods,
    parallel
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    ggplot2,
    waldo (>= 0.3.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/hdbt/pwrSim
